<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1037742" n="6r"/>
  <opener>
<salute rend="center"><lb/>Viro Excellentissimo et Celeberrimo Johanni Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruo</rs> suo <choice><abbr>pl.</abbr><expan>plurime</expan></choice> honorando <abbr>S. P<supplied>.</supplied> D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person"><abbr>Nic. B.</abbr></rs></salute>
  </opener>
  <p>Non minimam sensi voluptatem, Patrue honoratissime, ex lectione <rs type="letter">literarum</rs><note>Dieser Brief von Joh. I B. an Nic. I B. ist anscheinend nicht erhalten.</note> Tuarum, qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus me certiorem facere dignatus es sinceri Tui in me affectus, quem ut mihi porro
      <lb/>conserves illibatum, su<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>opere peto; ego juxta gratiarum actionem, quam Tibi pro continua<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tione favoris Tui debeo, omni opera a<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>itar, ut eundem ulterius demereri queam. Consili<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>um quod mihi suggeris saluberrimum, ut discipulum meum Matri su<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> relinquam, se<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quar, proinde his regionibus quamprimum discedere et <choice><orig><g ref="#klammerauf">|:</g></orig><reg>(</reg></choice>si Deus volet et Parentes a<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>uant<choice><orig><g ref="#klammerzu">:|</g></orig><reg>)</reg></choice> iter in <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Galliam</rs> suscipere constitui. <rs key="place_GEO-2660646" type="place">Genev<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> per aliquot hebdomadas co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>orari, ibi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>demque <rs key="pers_DE-588-103763058" type="person">Fatium</rs> compellare animus est, huic ut me aut aliis co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>endare velis rogo. Magnam
<pb facs="1037743" n="6v"/>
      <lb/>etiam <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me inibis gratiam, si <rs key="pers_DE-588-119062372" type="person">Varignonium</rs> rogaveris, ut mihi <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>odum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rat
      <lb/>hospitium. <choice><abbr>Dnum</abbr><expan>Dominum</expan></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089640587" type="person">Graffenried</rs><note>Es handelt sich mit grosser Wahrscheinlichkeit um den Berner Franz Ludwig von Graffenried (1688-1767), Sohn von Albrecht (1656-1714), der in Basel Jura studierte (Matrikel Basel IV, Nr. 2256).</note> hospitium Tuum et mensam Tuam cum illa Doctoris <rs key="pers_DE-588-129684406" type="person">Plateri</rs>
      <lb/>co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>utasse miror, de causis certe discessus ejus nihil boni ominari licet. <rs key="pers_DE-588-1072469103" type="person">Henricum Beckium</rs>,
      <lb/>qui olim Tuus fuit co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>ensalis,<note>Johann Heinrich Beck (1687-1735) stammte aus Riehen bei Basel.</note> <rs key="place_GEO-2660646" type="place">Genev<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> studia Juris nunc iterum tractare audivi.<note>Nic. I B. hat aus 1710-03-08_Christ_Franz-Bernoulli_Nicolaus von Beck erfahren.</note>
      <lb/>Sed quid agit tertius co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>ensalis Tuus, <foreign xml:lang="grc">μισάνθρωπο</foreign> ille <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089923198" type="person">Verzaglia</rs>, anne adhuc <rs key="place_GEO-2973783" type="place">Ar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gentin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> delitescit, Teque nullis dignatur literis? credo illum verno hoc tempore Patri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>am suam repetiturum esse, ubi cum sui similibus optatam vitam agere poterit. Nuntia etiam mihi, si placet, an aliquam ab <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Herma<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>o</rs> ad literas nostras responsio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem acceperis, et an nihil de <rs key="pers_DE-588-104185643" type="person">Burneto</rs> inaudiveris, forsan ille jam in Patriam redux
      <lb/>literas ad Te dedit. Procerum nostrorum Academicorum protestatio contra Rh<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>torum
      <lb/>appellationem ad Magistratum Politicum quemnam habuerit successum, scire desi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dero, ut et num animadversiones<note>Op. LXXXIV {publ. von P. R. de Montmort} Lettre de M. (Jean) Bernoulli à M. de M...[Bearbeiten], pp. 283–298 in: Essay d’Analyse sur les Jeux de Hazard. Seconde Edition, Revûe <choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice> augmentée de plusieurs Lettres. A Paris, Chez Jacque Quillau, Imprimeur-Juré-Libraire de l’Université, rue Galande. MDCCXIII. Avec Approbation et Privilege du Roy. Ein Entwurf des Briefs an Montmort von 1710.03.17 ist Ms UB Basel L I a 665, N<hi rend="sup">o</hi> 2 (8 fol.) (https://ub.unibas.ch/bernoulli/index.php?title=1710-03-17_Bernoulli_Johann_I-Montmort_Pierre_Remond_de); die Abfertigung ist verloren. Eine Beilage mit Bemerkungen von Nicolaus I Bernoulli ist im «Essay d’Analyse», aber nicht in Johanns Opera abgedruckt, ebenso Montmorts Antwort vom 15.11.1710.</note> in <rs key="pers_DE-588-117601020" type="person">Montmortii</rs> libellum Auctori miseris, et q[ua]m<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nam <rs key="B_991170514996905501" type="letter">responsionem</rs> ab eo tuleris;<note>Montmort antwortete erst 1710.11.15: https://ub.unibas.ch/bernoulli/index.php/1710-11-15_Montmort_Pierre_Remond_de-Bernoulli_Johann_I</note> fortasse <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> de ejusmodi rebus cum eo colloquen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di et nos in aliis etiam Problematibus exercendi occasio dabitur.<note>Reise Nic. I B.s nach Paris.</note> Interim Valete quamplurimum Tu et honoratissima Tua <rs key="pers_DE-588-108991332X" type="person">conjux</rs>, mihique porro favete. Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-2661552" type="place">Bern<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1719-04-09">9. Aprilis 1710.</date>
  </p>
</div>
